  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ue2b49bda\" id=\"ue2b49bda\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud659a68f\" id=\"ud659a68f\">https://robot.zhongzhi.com/docs/ros/pid/intro/</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"F7rnC\" id=\"F7rnC\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd63cdce\" id=\"ucd63cdce\">纵向扫地</span></h1><card type=\"block\" name=\"video\" value=\"data:%7B%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22z1.mp4%22%2C%22size%22%3A1846554%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8d0c59d0-03cd-4a75-abef-474048dae05%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22url%22%3Anull%2C%22cover%22%3Anull%2C%22videoId%22%3A%22inputs%2Fprod%2Fyuque%2F2024%2F27903758%2Fmp4%2F1730446904471-9f4d5775-e54e-42ce-aa57-41972b88adf8.mp4%22%2C%22download%22%3Afalse%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lw7uP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"xIwkN\" id=\"xIwkN\"><span data-lake-id=\"u329dce3e\" id=\"u329dce3e\">横向扫地</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u51a73734\" id=\"u51a73734\"><br></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"video\" value=\"data:%7B%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22z2.mp4%22%2C%22size%22%3A1829355%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf25ba351-2f05-4ab7-8633-05f1694e21d%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22url%22%3Anull%2C%22cover%22%3Anull%2C%22videoId%22%3A%22inputs%2Fprod%2Fyuque%2F2024%2F27903758%2Fmp4%2F1730446985949-88a0f317-a117-413e-ae19-975b6269b7ef.mp4%22%2C%22download%22%3Afalse%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tHjLj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"uwfER\" id=\"uwfER\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f3a62f1\" id=\"u6f3a62f1\">回字形扫地</span></h1><card type=\"block\" name=\"video\" value=\"data:%7B%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22z3.mp4%22%2C%22size%22%3A1439388%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0a0a0a60-0c98-4898-a262-f8e3eb88244%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22url%22%3Anull%2C%22cover%22%3Anull%2C%22videoId%22%3A%22inputs%2Fprod%2Fyuque%2F2024%2F27903758%2Fmp4%2F1730446997488-3085f90c-d9f1-49d8-baaa-c9c219352b7e.mp4%22%2C%22download%22%3Afalse%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K5ms0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"lXiRP\" id=\"lXiRP\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0699d666\" id=\"u0699d666\">实现分析</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u68a62cc5\" id=\"u68a62cc5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u73d26a13\" id=\"u73d26a13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">小乌龟是按照一定的方式进行移动的，在整个移动过程中，小乌龟都是有自己的路径的，路径的规划是需要考虑的。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u48930e37\" id=\"u48930e37\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a236b41\" id=\"u3a236b41\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">路径规划的算法有很多，但是根本就是生成一系列的点，将点按照顺序连在一起就是路径和轨迹了，点越多，路径越清晰。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5a8c8644\" id=\"u5a8c8644\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689637799274-6e51e9e9-4b3f-4955-a8d4-036ba2081d1f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7f27f283-714a-4c84-86cd-1abcc081214%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc48992fa-a5e0-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A336%2C%22height%22%3A260%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid1.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A13586%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A756%2C%22originHeight%22%3A586%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%237d8590%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3a1b46ea%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua1fba069\" id=\"ua1fba069\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0b001a1\" id=\"ud0b001a1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">目前小乌龟案例中，我们要解决的是小乌龟由一个点到另外一个点的运动。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u21c9927d\" id=\"u21c9927d\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689637826126-9860d60b-610e-4ae3-9e2f-dfd606e06604.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u75043711-eca9-4cc6-913b-eb2b4b0d73e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc48992fa-a5e0-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A169.7777862548828%2C%22height%22%3A145%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid2.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A14298%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A265%2C%22originHeight%22%3A227%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9E%9C%E9%A9%AC%E8%B4%A7%E5%BA%8F%40%22%2C%22x%22%3A198%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%230b0907%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u67b9c986%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uea88430d\" id=\"uea88430d\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc742b9f\" id=\"udc742b9f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">小乌龟运动的特点是，前进或是转角，前进控制了移动的距离，转角控制了移动的方向。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u786dcf65\" id=\"u786dcf65\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub87b7e7f\" id=\"ub87b7e7f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">要控制小乌龟移动到具体的点，就是要解决前进和转向的问题。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u457568b7\" id=\"u457568b7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb717963\" id=\"ufb717963\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"udf12ea96\" id=\"udf12ea96\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689664035324-6a6af0c0-872c-4092-b0c4-42e97e4c36e3.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufd879b51-987a-48d4-8a42-5622cd3326a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22udf3c820a-2348-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A195.33333587646484%2C%22height%22%3A312%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A24752%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A273%2C%22originHeight%22%3A436%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%228.544444561%22%2C%22x%22%3A106%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225.544444561%22%2C%22x%22%3A107%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8DJTHETA%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A196%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%89%AB%E5%9C%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A144%2C%22y%22%3A385%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87Y%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87X%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8DY%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A162%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A164%2C%22y%22%3A342%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8DX%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TEST%22%2C%22x%22%3A117%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KD%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A9%2C%22y%22%3A303%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.1%22%2C%22x%22%3A106%2C%22y%22%3A303%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.1%22%2C%22x%22%3A106%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KP%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KL%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y